I have enough to answer. The survey's "Restarts: -" column hid the one real restart: ts-ticket-office restarts 3 times in both periods, so it is background noise, while ts-train-food-service's restart is new in the abnormal window.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-train-food-service",
      "fault_kind": "pod_failure",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT time, attr_k8s_pod_name, metric, value FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'ts-train-food-service%' AND metric='k8s.container.restarts' AND value>0 ORDER BY time LIMIT 5",
          "claim": "ts-train-food-service pod restart counter goes from 0 to 1 during the incident window; no restarts in normal period."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT date_trunc('minute', time) m, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-train-food-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1",
          "claim": "ts-train-food-service server spans drop to zero in the 12:56 minute (18 at 12:55, 88 at 12:57), a gap consistent with a brief outage then recovery."
        },
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT time, message FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='ts-food-service' AND level='SEVERE' ORDER BY time LIMIT 3",
          "claim": "ts-food-service logs 'Connection refused' on GET to http://ts-train-food-service:8080 during the same window."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-train-food-service",
      "to": "ts-food-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT date_trunc('minute', time) m, attr_status_code, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-food-service' AND span_name='GET' AND attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY 1,2 ORDER BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Food's outgoing GET calls to train-food fail with Error (132 total) only in 12:56–12:57, the same window as train-food's outage."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-food-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
